  "criticalEvidence": [
    "AudioManager3421 ctor creates nodes dictionary and Android-id dictionary, field36 empty string; config/once maps null, flagsfalse. get_Instance26364 caches normal CLR instance. Destroy26353 does not clear manager singleton; UIAudioManager.Destroy clears only its own slot.",
    "InitAudioManager26368 delegates26365. Initialized flag33 guard first; when ConfigRead resource null and AppSetting new-resource flag36false, log error and return without changing maps. Otherwise log then replace audio dictionary, readConfig<AudioData>(\"AudioConfig\") via generic metadata26612. Null list still proceeds. Live indexed rows: duplicate id logs and keeps first, then all rows including duplicates scan ResPath.ToLower().Contains(\"audio/once\") and can set sticky flag32.",
    "After audio rows, replace Once dictionary. If sticky UseOnceAudio log and ConfigRead26625 readOnceAudioConfig into dictionary. Flag33=true is written only after data work succeeds but before root/listener setup. ClearNode does not reset UseOnceAudio or Once/Android caches; reinit after Clear retains sticky once requirement.",
    "ConfigRead26625 warns when no legacy resource and no new route, still loads OnceAudioConfig. Actual JsonUtility generic4004888 resolves AudioList2893 with AudioInfos; each item Name/string Length -> float.Parse(current culture) -> Dictionary.Add. Missing asset logs exact message. Duplicate or invalid values propagate and preserve earlier additions. AudioConfig adapter explicitly implements already-proven UnityJson readConfig branch; modern loader/MemoryPack route not claimed.",
    "Root creation26346 creates new AudioRoot via Utils.NewGameObject with null parent, then DontDestroyOnLoad. Listener26347 creates new AudioListener GameObject + component, no separate persistence call. Ensure26367 invokes root then MoveAudioListen(1). Move26363 gets UIModule3558 camera field24 before ensuring listener; type1 and non-null camera parent it with worldPositionStays defaulttrue; other types leave hierarchy untouched.",
    "CreateNode26366 ensures root/listener only if root Unity-null; snapshots node dictionary Keys only if nonempty; RandomId(1,10000,keys), default null/destroyed parent to root; creates parallel_/sequence_/single_+id with source constructors for modes1/2/3, invalid returnsnull after preceding work. Registration26359 nullguards node/dictionary then set_Item, not Add.",
    "Random wrapper26370 delegates Utils wasm6831. Unity Random.Range returns chosen id; for each matching excluded id recursively calls RandomId but discards result. Original chosen id still returned, allowing dictionary overwrite while old native node remains. No uniqueness repair is invented.",
    "ClearNode26348 enumerates live node dictionary and virtual slot6 Stop(voice0), NOT slot8 Destroy; after all stops clears nodes, clears audio map, sets initializedfalse. Failure/mutation aborts subsequent cleanup. Destroy then destroys root through GlobalUnityEngineAPI (always sets rootnull after success or already fake-null), destroys listener GameObject and clears listener only inside live-object branch, then gets UI singleton and clears its slot.",
    "GetAudioData26345 null map or absent key returnsnull. GetAndroid26352 absent returns empty string. Once query26356 disabled logs error returns0 before accessing dictionary; enabled dictionary lookup case-sensitive, missing warning0. Settings26354 already restored delegates source prefs/message behavior."
